Once again the Apostle spoke concerning {29}
{30} the Father, one after another. He said {32} in this manner: '{33}
{34} from his mind, the Beloved of the Lights;
{35} the Mother of Life; from his teaching {36}
the Beloved; from his counsel, the Virgin of Light; {37}
from his reflection.' Thus then is the manner in which they were called forth, {38}
Fathers — in this coming they came forth from the Five Members {39}
one came forth from another, and was revealed forth from his lot.
